{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-11-3","kind":"proposition","title":"两个相交平面的交线是一条直线","englishTitle":"If two planes cut one another, their common section is a straight line.","book":11,"number":3,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.3","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.3/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":3,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-11-3@raw-8dc159d50646cc11","contentId":"euclid-11-3","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8dc159d50646cc11e0e769fe5e1adcfbd60d4c51ec66ffe132bc22c7338d8606","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-11-3.statement","euclid-11-3.construction.1","euclid-11-3.proof.1","euclid-11-3.proof.2","euclid-11-3.proof.3","euclid-11-3.proof.4","euclid-11-3.conclusion","euclid-11-3.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-11-3.statement","contentId":"euclid-11-3","revisionId":"euclid-11-3@raw-8dc159d50646cc11","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"709171c01e47407b72e98561ff1d94bce46ba44b2d492639948a65ffd6727112","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If two planes cut one another, their common section is a straight line."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果两个平面互相切开, 它们的共同部分就是直线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-3.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-11-3","revisionId":"euclid-11-3@raw-8dc159d50646cc11","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"04974cf890fd39857d27d4e5659e8c37d9cc70aecb7b4cd832099d2e5ba91f13","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the two planes AB, BC cut one another, and let the line DB be their common section; I say that the line DB is a straight line."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让这两条平面 AB,BC线相互切开,让第DB线成为它们的共同部分;我说第DB线是一条直线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-3.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-11-3","revisionId":"euclid-11-3@raw-8dc159d50646cc11","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"252bb734a7f2c4b4d74390e54f027068a4d280933faf5581b9c151998dfba55f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if not, from D to B let the straight line DEB be joined in the plane AB, and in the plane BC the straight line DFB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果不是,则从D到B,将直线 DEB连接到平面 AB线,将第平面 BC直线连接到DFB线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-3.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-11-3","revisionId":"euclid-11-3@raw-8dc159d50646cc11","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bab4581c5d78d058a0512f95eb1f3bd82bd22137dfa900129bf5f6fe7c21d1fb","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then the two straight lines DEB, DFB will have the same extremities, and will clearly enclose an area: which is absurd."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"这两条直线DEB,DFB 将具有相同的高度, 并将清楚地包含一个区域:这是荒谬的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-3.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-11-3","revisionId":"euclid-11-3@raw-8dc159d50646cc11","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1abafc09f9a32d2e2a7b5c3b5801c7c91436eba51662476fd6c1f0d908e23250","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore DEB, DFB are not straight lines."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,DEB,DFB不是直线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-3.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-11-3","revisionId":"euclid-11-3@raw-8dc159d50646cc11","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b675fe7d9f14dd256f700e4556ad4a585a8693a03102c7d520f2d6a4a40163ab","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Similarly we can prove that neither will there be any other straight line joined from D to B except DB the common section of the planes AB, BC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,我们可以证明,除了平面 AB BC公路的共同部分DB以外,没有其他直线连接到D至B公路。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-3.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-11-3","revisionId":"euclid-11-3@raw-8dc159d50646cc11","order":6,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-3.source","contentId":"euclid-11-3","revisionId":"euclid-11-3@raw-8dc159d50646cc11","order":7,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"58cdedc64f5c4f6d93e79a847ca99c3da374306cd89d1fcdeff7b273c1677e1f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.3/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.3\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[],"incomingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-11-5:euclid-11-3:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-11-5","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-11-5.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-11-3","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.5","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.5/","sourceLabel":"XI. 3"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-11-7:euclid-11-3:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-11-7","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-11-7.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-11-3","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.7","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.7/","sourceLabel":"XI. 3"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-11-13:euclid-11-3:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-11-13","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-11-13.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-11-3","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.13","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.13/","sourceLabel":"XI. 3"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-11-14:euclid-11-3:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-11-14","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-11-14.construction.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-11-3","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.14","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.14/","sourceLabel":"XI. 3"}}],"dependencies":[],"dependents":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-11-5:euclid-11-3:explicit","id":"euclid-11-5","book":11,"number":5,"kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：平面与角与线段","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-11-7:euclid-11-3:explicit","id":"euclid-11-7","book":11,"number":7,"kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：平面与平行线与线段","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-11-13:euclid-11-3:explicit","id":"euclid-11-13","book":11,"number":13,"kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：平面与角与线段","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-11-14:euclid-11-3:explicit","id":"euclid-11-14","book":11,"number":14,"kind":"proposition","title":"垂直同一直线的两个平面互相平行","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"visualization":{"level":"concept_illustration","rendererId":"concept-solid","rationale":"The current renderer is selected by a broad geometry family and must not be presented as this proposition’s exact construction."},"sourceIssues":[]}
